    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Limits of Intelligence</h2><br><strong>!!Important Update!! You can now design your own levels and share them on the Workshop! You can also play levels created by others!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979950/extras/15794e1be474c6c0297e8f27cac8c759.poster.avif?t=1716973214\" width=784 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979950/extras/15794e1be474c6c0297e8f27cac8c759.webm?t=1716973214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979950/extras/15794e1be474c6c0297e8f27cac8c759.mp4?t=1716973214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Test your intelligence with physics puzzles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979950/extras/d2a96b97659b500232bd1501253090f1.poster.avif?t=1716973214\" width=784 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979950/extras/d2a96b97659b500232bd1501253090f1.webm?t=1716973214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979950/extras/d2a96b97659b500232bd1501253090f1.mp4?t=1716973214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Create your own machine. Engineer it!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979950/extras/2e3b10dd07df635b2401c5a996dca768.poster.avif?t=1716973214\" width=784 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979950/extras/2e3b10dd07df635b2401c5a996dca768.webm?t=1716973214\" ty